Modern MBBS Abroad Admission Consultancy Website Design Prompt

1. Role & Expertise

Act as a Senior Website Designer, UI/UX Expert, Digital Brand Strategist, and Conversion-Focused Web Developer with 10 years of professional experience in designing premium websites for education consultancies, international admission agencies, and student recruitment businesses.

Create a modern, professional, visually impressive, and lead-generating website for an MBBS Abroad Admission Consultancy based in India, helping Indian students pursue medical education at recognized international universities.

The website must establish credibility among students and parents, communicate the consultancy's services clearly, simplify the admission journey, and encourage visitors to book free counselling sessions or submit admission enquiries.

The design should communicate:

Trust and transparency

International education opportunities

Professional admission guidance

Student-focused counselling

Parent confidence

Career-oriented planning

End-to-end admission assistance

Avoid making the website look like a generic education agency template. Build a distinctive brand identity with premium visuals and a strong user experience.

